                                                "sense_id": "2ddccb04-9dcd-3862-b094-164f82fabeb3",
                                                "text": "By the 1980s, English language teachers generally had begun to realize that there had been a neglect of lexis in teaching methods and coursebooks. […] The basic truth that without vocabulary or lexis we can't express anything had to be restated and a new approach to teaching lexis was needed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
